        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "57c76787-b95a-3eec-b96b-93dd8c21ef11",
                "word": "aspersion",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e4a6b3a9-7214-4d2f-b8b5-05acd7bc91a9",
                        "entry_id": "57c76787-b95a-3eec-b96b-93dd8c21ef11",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "aspersions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                        "entry_id": "57c76787-b95a-3eec-b96b-93dd8c21ef11",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’asperger, de projeter des gouttes de liquide sur quelque chose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "daff2a60-8f79-45cd-9653-773562a98fd9",
                                "sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                                "text": "Un des moyens de sauvegarde du REP dénommé aspersion, consiste en l’injection de pulvérisations d’eau froide dans l’enceinte de confinement dans le but de faire baisser la pression interne et la température de celle-ci, du fait des échanges de masse et de chaleur entre les gouttes d’eau et le mélange gazeux composé d’air, de vapeur d’eau et d’hydrogène."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5048b2dc-ee06-4bc9-a3dd-9f288068c2b9",
                                "sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                                "text": "Une bâche de 1000 m² qui la recouvre et un dispositif d’aspersion de gouttes d’eau contribuent à éviter les projections alentour et à limiter la diffusion des poussières."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9631f131-7a95-40b3-8195-079909d5d106",
                                "sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                                "text": "Les laveuses à aspersion furent toutes différentes, le battement de la laine se fait par aspersion d’eau savonneuse."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb4a4053-8590-4c8c-9e32-e8bf8e9e33b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "57c76787-b95a-3eec-b96b-93dd8c21ef11",
                        "source_sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                        "target_lang_word": "aspersion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aspersion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1257d9bb-06b8-310f-ad3d-0e5f794bcfec",
                                        "entry_id": "b2d0178a-81c7-3681-b85d-807254964b1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An attack on somebody's reputation or good name, often in the phrase to cast aspersions upon…."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "672940b6-e729-4324-9bf7-f361e9ebf6e0",
                                                "sense_id": "1257d9bb-06b8-310f-ad3d-0e5f794bcfec",
                                                "text": "No criminality can be infered or punishment inflicted, but for writing, printing, uttering, or publishing false, scandalous and malicious aspersions against the government."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eb4ac4b-8666-4d5a-aab0-76e796a981f8",
                                                "sense_id": "1257d9bb-06b8-310f-ad3d-0e5f794bcfec",
                                                "text": "Even the comfort of the bottle might conceivably fail him in this supreme crisis. At such an age nothing but a halter could cure the pangs of an unquenchable passion. And, besides, there was the wild exasperation aroused by the unjust aspersions and the contumely of the house, with the maddening impossibility to account for that mysterious thrashing, added to these simple and bitter sorrows."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59a8b265-6e0e-4099-9f3a-2c9a9868490c",
                                                "sense_id": "1257d9bb-06b8-310f-ad3d-0e5f794bcfec",
                                                "text": "Back in 2018, the body representing the water industry was snorting at Gove’s aspersions, declaring hotly that it looked forward to its pet regulator “bringing some sorely needed facts and balance to the debate”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fe0d96d-332d-3d1f-ab69-6795f920810c",
                                        "entry_id": "b2d0178a-81c7-3681-b85d-807254964b1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sprinkling, especially of holy water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be14196a-e368-42f1-9076-755159204d6b",
                                                "sense_id": "9fe0d96d-332d-3d1f-ab69-6795f920810c",
                                                "text": "If thou dost break her virgin knot before\nAll sanctimonious ceremonies may\nWith full and holy rite be minister'd,\nNo sweet aspersion shall the heavens let fall\nTo make this contract grow; but barren hate […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "71cf48db-9cb7-40bd-a914-ffb3cef3df88",
                        "source_entry_id": "57c76787-b95a-3eec-b96b-93dd8c21ef11",
                        "source_sense_id": "5402830e-2fa5-376d-b3aa-f1447841c940",
                        "target_lang_word": "sprinkling",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
